{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "856ee46e9d9d5f0d9ac59be64b1432ae5790d2b4b1cd0d20a45138230191e4b9", "ja": "第四幕、お疲れさま！", "zh": "第四幕辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9a3a53bc8f1d6337bb6b6631ec2e9eb96543268a25da52a2b47d70d5398837c", "ja": "第四幕も無事に千秋楽を迎え、打ち上げに\n向かうメンバーとプロデューサー。その間も\nこの先の物語について、真珠星はどうなって\nいくのか、湊はチャラい、なるは大丈夫か\nなど、話は尽きないのだった。", "zh": "第四幕也顺利迎来了千秋乐，成员们和制作人一起前往庆功宴。路上大家还在聊着今后的故事——真珠星会变成什么样、湊很花心、なる没问题吧……话题一个接一个，怎么也聊不完。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "96053d85048ce8832d598a90b5e93b04ec2341bfaa20cc446c9e61d6de2cb95c", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』。第四幕は\n熱量の高いまま、千秋楽を迎える事ができた）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》。第四幕也终于在高涨的热情中顺利迎来了最终公演）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "c563b8ab7075e16cde4f9c7744539b66aff8af29dec193b06120bbd8deb157ff", "ja": "今日の打ち上げって、この辺なんですよね？\n表参道なんて滅多に来ないから、緊張しちゃう……。", "zh": "今天的庆功宴是在这附近，对吧？\n我平时很少来表参道，紧张得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "83c055f2951876e01589ffe28628cc4e52bf0ae7c767114846fa3cb24d6c3a88", "ja": "歩いてる人も、オシャレな大人の人ばっかりで……\nわ、私、本当にここにいていいのかな～！？", "zh": "连走在路上的人也全都是些时髦的大人……\n\n我、我真的可以待在这里吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bb0265cca92481224f8d6c565841fdea77e0068e7b0b6bd1cb8f7e1ae3aa0788", "ja": "そんなに緊張しなくても大丈夫だよ。\n若い人だってたくさんいるし。な、恵美。", "zh": "不用那么紧张，没事的。年轻人也有很多。对吧，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "61a4c875521ffdc76af75361b0748c958b9714519d44073915b197ac379d14bd", "ja": "そうそう！　それに今日は、{$P$}が\n一緒だし、何にも心配いらないからね！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "对对！而且今天还有{$P$}一起，什么都不用担心啦！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6db05d3238cdb515d75ae146dfde7f34963edcb433283ff3bbeb2e1f2e56443a", "ja": "恵美は主演、本当によく頑張ってくれたな。\n座長お疲れ様！", "zh": "惠美担任主演，真的非常努力啊。\n座长，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "3fd6e9cef68fca14e065ed46aad7c0d4b94043944b19ca08c4b5a0d2342aafaf", "ja": "へ！？　……も、も～！！\n{$P$}、急に褒めるのナシ！", "zh": "诶！？……真、真是的～！！\n{$P$}，不许突然夸我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "afad9667c4cef044cae5e3686d48c9395e18bb5b5366a41c45f091fb17634458", "ja": "恵美の真珠星、本当に素敵だった。\n等身大の女の子って感じで。", "zh": "恵美的《真珠星》，真的很棒。\n有种贴近同龄普通女孩的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "2c1dafcf5bcbc71c6a3dc592e1fe3fef98b55001b044d0dcef74488afeb309a6", "ja": "きっと、素敵なアイドルになるんだろうな……。", "zh": "她一定会成为一名出色的偶像吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "ab18a505630877994ed14732b7730dc498caf58916f7ab440631a36072550eca", "ja": "ウンウン！　同じ舞台に立ってるけど、\n自慢したくなっちゃうよネ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！虽然我们站在同一个舞台上，但还是会忍不住想夸耀她呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "36a669dffe6a7d3ef1217c9f3f210fa303b1e7524a570a68c6718d195d126a04", "ja": "これが、ワタシたちのメグミだぞ～！　えっへん！\n……ってネ♪", "zh": "这就是我们的惠美哦～！　哼哼，厉害吧！\n……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "5c56c1852394e574c329643b86f202e9854c981e76245310586c229f4fef19d4", "ja": "琴葉！　エレナも！\nアタシを褒めたって、何にも出ないからね？", "zh": "琴叶！还有艾琳娜也是！\n就算你们夸我，也什么都不会得到哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "ee38adcda5f9d4794abb29b5c00d707cfd3c26c7ae7156ab908f06445cda14ac", "ja": "……でも、ありがと。\nみんなのおかげで、うまくやれたと思う！", "zh": "……不过，谢谢啦。\n多亏了大家，我想才能表现得这么好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "f5ad560572fa1bda85b28f45fb0ed9c1a810c74c5787f41d04ddd523f2d745ad", "ja": "可奈と美奈子は、どうだった？\n楽しかった？", "zh": "可奈和美奈子觉得怎么样？\n开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "48aeca53d0839ab3f8341ec906f13ff9b831a836d562fbc72b5323ddcbd3e723", "ja": "うん！　クロエ、すっごく新鮮だった。\nみんなと一緒だったし、楽しく演じられたかな♪", "zh": "嗯！演克洛伊的感觉特别新鲜。  \n而且还和大家一起，感觉演得很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "ab7bf2d48516235074f6d297055ce5df6d7bc7352e697704a9cacd815fcce8c5", "ja": "私も、なるちゃんみたいな女の子が\n演じられて、楽しかったです！", "zh": "我也能演绎像Naru那样的女孩子，觉得很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "77218e412c76f2b9512780dd89f0258d255eeb486036e35bb2af6c90e0ef671d", "ja": "でも、それよりなにより気になるのは……\nお話の続きがどうなるのかで……！", "zh": "不过，比起那些，我更在意的是……\n故事接下来会怎么发展……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "af34620c81264b5f518473bf54224a6bdc334ea9dd5e05766cd75ffdff497805", "ja": "わかる！！", "zh": "我懂！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "af34620c81264b5f518473bf54224a6bdc334ea9dd5e05766cd75ffdff497805", "ja": "わかる！！", "zh": "我懂！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "af34620c81264b5f518473bf54224a6bdc334ea9dd5e05766cd75ffdff497805", "ja": "わかる！！", "zh": "我懂！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "af34620c81264b5f518473bf54224a6bdc334ea9dd5e05766cd75ffdff497805", "ja": "わかる！！", "zh": "我懂！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6f01f051728faa047f071b69d8072db7cfe6f9d7b369830913926f626d42b96c", "ja": "（ビクッ）", "zh": "（猛地一惊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "d27693c24822378f2e236cf288c0dc2618f6c6e7c22d88f8591abc2cf9ce81a6", "ja": "真珠星も押しに負けて連絡先教えちゃったしさ～。\nな～んか信用できないんだよね、湊！", "zh": "连真珠星都被他逼得把联系方式告诉他了嘛～\n总觉得让人信不过啊，湊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "778c867e1ef6ea4402ad6179a3bf080267fc51a33ab7e196649d5cb17a257aca", "ja": "悪い事をしている訳ではないんだけど……。\nただ、ひたすらチャラいだけで……。", "zh": "也不是在做什么坏事……  \n只是单纯太轻浮了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "a0834d3cdb4e3635b8258891e7fb15ff84598fe0fe01a6a6a81b4a0de181507c", "ja": "でも、なるが連絡先交換の場面を\n目撃しちゃったからネ……。心配だヨ～……。", "zh": "不过，我亲眼看到なる交换联系方式的场面了嘛……所以有点担心呀～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "42fdc0a3b2be36e64140c2358ab66d36d5bb989c3f3c5f48591149d5aedaff38", "ja": "そこなんだよね～。幼馴染だけじゃない気持ちが、\nなるちゃんにはやっぱりあるのかな～……。", "zh": "就是这里让人在意呢～。なる果然还有不只是青梅竹马的感情吗～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1048b369ab526097c73a8777e10acd2c8d7d64ccc77996a5e19bf9a19b110f05", "ja": "み、みんな。盛り上がるのは結構だけど、\n外で仕事の話は控えめにな……。", "zh": "大、大家。热闹起来是好事，不过在外面还是少聊工作上的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "69ced9889779da33e2e3e3c6dad497da3648dd2716e1ec5a74e992fef25d1ac8", "ja": "ハッ！？　そ、そうでした。\nすみません、つい……！", "zh": "哈！？对、对哦。抱歉，一不小心就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "4a5efdb97bc8338db02245eb3fc5406cca7470458ec0c4649d5c64b9a5b6ee5f", "ja": "エヘヘ。みんなといると、どこにいたって\nすぐおしゃべりしちゃうネ。", "zh": "嘿嘿。和大家待在一起的话，不管在哪里，\n都会马上聊起天来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "fa9207c877304214e7c6761356e6540b01522afc3d189ebf78d35abce25b8b0c", "ja": "それじゃあ、続きはお店で！\n確かパンケーキが有名なカフェだっけ？", "zh": "那就待会儿在店里接着聊吧！\n我记得那家咖啡店的松饼很有名，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb16563f50f560b517322ad17e1ffbad9f7180dbf0ccc6e3de2093d4786ce2e2", "ja": "はい！　ふわふわパンケーキに、それ以上の\n山盛りクリームが乗ってるらしいです♪", "zh": "是的！听说松软的松饼上，还堆着比松饼更高的满满奶油呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "ca28a2a5ce2410aa966805831c63fbc5e1319d25318ccec1894cb53bf445392a", "ja": "おお～、聞くだけでおいしそう！\n盛り付けの参考にさせてもらおうっと！", "zh": "哦哦～光是听着就觉得好吃！\n我得拿来参考一下摆盘才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d73211f6f36e37e7fc331dc6e50b24260555a363ed763d7b422f2a5a808b13eb", "ja": "（第四幕は、真珠星のアイドル活動が開始。\n物語が大きく動き出した……）", "zh": "（第四幕开始了真珠星的偶像活动。故事开始有了巨大的进展……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0345_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f2da89a9c4c3c9a3fa71a60f4cc3dbc49e7c6ec9474ff6ae88a830d2fd8772a6", "ja": "（続く第五幕、アイドル達がどういった表現で\n見せてくれるのか……期待しつつ見届けよう！）", "zh": "（接下来的第五幕，偶像们会用怎样的表现来展现呢……让我们怀着期待继续看下去吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
